+ ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
```

## Apply and test
1. Back up: `sudo cp -a /etc/nginx /etc/nginx.bak-<date>`
2. Edit, then `sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx`
3. Checks:
